From 14a731218b2fbc71d549fbab3c117be9fd8a1431 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: WeiguangTWK <weiguangtwk@outlook.com>
Date: Thu, 9 Jul 2026 13:36:19 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Neko LineageOS: Add a LOCK state for TaskView & move 'clear
 all' button

- This feature is inspired by MIUI's design, when drag down the app in TaskView will switch the lock state of the app,
  Which determine how 'clear all' deal with it
- Move the 'clear all' button to the bottom area of the screen

Change-Id: Idae834d7e55147d4c2e9a9405f34e147fcfbf5fb
